Wait? Wait? 15 seconds of talking time?

127
00:18:37,660 --> 00:18:40,310
待って?待って? フィルターも大量
Wait? Wait? Tons of filters too!

128
00:18:40,710 --> 00:18:43,580
毎日頑張ってるもん 愛しいでしょ? もっと伝われ
I work hard every day, aren't I lovely? Get across even more,

129
00:18:43,860 --> 00:18:46,810
伝われ 目を離しちゃダメ!
Get across, don't take your eyes off me!

130
00:18:46,990 --> 00:18:49,440
あざとい顔してはにゃはにゃ♡
Making a sly face with a cute grin♡

131
00:18:50,390 --> 00:18:54,540
君と1,2,3できゅんです あっちゅーま夢中です 頭くらっくらでクライシス
With you, 1,2,3 it's "kyun", in no time I'm obsessed, a crisis with my head spinning.

132
00:18:54,970 --> 00:18:57,730
なんちゃってじゃないよ 何だってしちゃうもん
It's not just a joke, I'd do anything!

133
00:18:57,990 --> 00:19:01,100
ちょま!私ピュアすぎ?
Hold on! Am I too pure?

134
00:19:01,190 --> 00:19:06,510
純粋に 従順に 君のために つまり実質私のため
Purely, obediently for your sake, which basically means for my own sake.

135
00:19:07,210 --> 00:19:12,570
A to Zお給仕 溶けちゃってほしい メイドイン愛のメイド
A to Z service, I want you to melt away, a maid made of love.

136
00:19:13,190 --> 00:19:18,690
くりでいかる♡ぷりちー Cute! Cute! Cute! きゅん!
Critical♡Pretty, Cute! Cute! Cute! Kyun!

137
00:19:19,120 --> 00:19:24,620
くりでいかる♡ぷりちー Cute! Cute! Cute! きゅん!
Critical♡Pretty, Cute! Cute! Cute! Kyun!

138
00:19:34,020 --> 00:19:38,620
考えらんなくなっちゃってあ～もうね～めろちい♡
I can't even think anymore, oh jeez, I'm head over heels♡

139
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:43,650
自己採点常に満点 やば!わーにん めちゃ!ぱに甘すぎスパイク
Self-scoring always full marks. Whoa! Warning! Super overly sweet spike!

140
00:19:43,870 --> 00:19:48,420
気絶しちゃうほどの愛をあげるから ちょうだい?
I'll give you a love so strong you'll faint, so will you give me yours?

141
00:19:48,910 --> 00:19:52,020
すぐに悩んじゃう 健気だよね?
Worrying right away, how endearing is that?

142
00:19:52,370 --> 00:19:56,970
もっと優しく 優しく 手を繋いでいて!
Hold my hand more gently, more gently!

143
00:19:57,540 --> 00:20:01,600
毎分毎秒いちゃいちゃ♡
Flirting every single minute and second♡

144
00:20:02,668 --> 00:20:04,588
君を独占余裕です 壊れる寸前
Monopolizing you with ease, on the verge of breaking

145
00:20:05,598 --> 00:20:07,998
心ふわふわでソアリング
Fluffy, airy, and soaring!

146
00:20:08,478 --> 00:20:10,918
私なしじゃ生きられないよ
I can't live without you

147
00:20:11,458 --> 00:20:13,798
好きになるおまじない
A spell to make you fall in love

148
00:20:16,258 --> 00:20:18,518
笑ってピース
Smile and peace!

149
00:20:18,978 --> 00:20:21,338
キメ顔ぱーん
Strike a pose with a bang!

150
00:20:22,298 --> 00:20:26,118
ハートにぐー！ 何をしてても一級品のフェイス
Heart to heart! Whatever you do, a first-class face

151
00:20:37,668 --> 00:20:43,598
愛してくれるから頑張れる 2人がいて成り立つアットホーム
I can do my best because you love me, a cozy home built by the two of us

152
00:20:44,318 --> 00:20:46,678
ところでどうです? 最近どうです?
How about it? How have you been lately?

153
00:20:47,098 --> 00:20:49,358
まだ足りなくない? もっと欲しくない?
Isn't it not enough? Don't you want more?

154
00:20:49,758 --> 00:20:54,038
私のところにおいで♡
Come over to my place

155
00:20:55,098 --> 00:20:58,618
君と1,2,3できゅんです あっちゅーま夢中です
Counting 1, 2, 3 with a 'kyun', instantly lost in a dream

156
00:20:58,978 --> 00:21:01,058
頭くらっくらでクライシス
My head is spinning, it's a crisis

157
00:21:01,738 --> 00:21:06,798
なんちゃってじゃないよ 何だってしちゃうもん ちょま!私ピュアすぎ?
It's not a joke! I'll do anything. Wait, am I too pure?

158
00:21:07,698 --> 00:21:13,218
純すいに 従順に 君のために つまり実質私のため
Purely, submissively, for your sake... which basically means for my own sake!

159
00:21:13,518 --> 00:21:18,498
A to Zお給仕 溶けちゃってほしい メイドイン愛のメイド
A to Z service, wanting to melt, a maid made of love

160
00:21:19,158 --> 00:21:22,698
くりてぃかる♡ぷりちー Cute! Cute! Cute! きゅん!
Critical ♡ Pretty, Cute! Cute! Cute! Kyun!

161
00:21:55,559 --> 00:22:01,699
焼き付けて この繚乱の高揚を
Burn this riotous climax into your memory

162
00:22:12,579 --> 00:22:19,079
太陽は知らない 月には届かない 絶望も希望も震える鼓動も
The sun doesn't know, the moon can't reach it, neither despair nor hope, nor the trembling heartbeat

163
00:22:19,999 --> 00:22:25,979
ざわめく人ごみのまとわりつく温度 今だけは心地よくなるの
The clinging warmth of the bustling crowd only now feels comforting

164
00:22:26,839 --> 00:22:33,439
遠雷に似た合図が響く 逸る想いと呼び合うように
A signal resembling distant thunder echoes, as if calling out to rushing emotions

165
00:22:34,099 --> 00:22:37,779
感じさせてよ もっと 愛を 暗闇に咲く葛藤と
Make me feel more love, along with the conflict blooming in the dark

166
00:22:46,499 --> 00:22:50,139
見つめ合いたい 沈黙を破って
I want to gaze into each other's eyes, breaking the silence

167
00:22:50,679 --> 00:22:57,019
降りそそぐたび 心 儚さに揺れて 鬱陶しいくらいの熱量に
Every time it pours down, my heart sways in its fleetingness, with an annoying amount of passion

168
00:22:59,519 --> 00:23:04,859
あぁ もう少し浮かされていたいな 息を呑んで そらさないで
Ah, I want to be swept away by it just a little longer... hold your breath and don't look away

169
00:23:06,479 --> 00:23:12,399
忘れたくない 繚乱の高揚を
I don't want to forget this riotous climax

170
00:23:23,379 --> 00:23:30,779
この先 何年も思い出すのでしょう らしくない君の汗伝う横顔
For years to come, we'll probably remember your out-of-character, sweat-glistened profile

171
00:23:31,199 --> 00:23:37,679
木下闇から覗く 裏腹な 眼差しは 何を見ていたの？
What was that contradictory gaze peeking from the shadows of the trees looking at?

172
00:23:38,539 --> 00:23:44,939
星の軌跡を夜風が融かす うたた心をくすぐるように
The night breeze melts the traces of the stars, as if tickling a dozing heart

173
00:23:50,439 --> 00:23:58,699
忘れさせてよ こんな憂いを 擦れた裸足の切なさも気にならないくらい
Let me forget such melancholy, to the point where even the sadness of my rubbed bare feet doesn't matter

174
00:23:59,479 --> 00:24:06,299
お揃いで買った飴がけの宝石を 舌で遊ばせて
Playing on our tongues with the matching candy-coated jewels we bought

175
00:24:06,519 --> 00:24:13,319
第三者目線じゃ 取るに足らない瞬間が たまらなく愛しいの
Moments that seem insignificant from a third-person perspective are unbearably precious

176
00:24:13,699 --> 00:24:20,839
終わらないで 明けるまで トキメキと喧騒に溺れたい
Don't end, until dawn breaks, I want to drown in the excitement and commotion

177
00:24:42,319 --> 00:24:49,679
花の命は なんて言って 色に出にけり感情を諦めたくない
What does a flower's life say? It shows in its colors; I don't want to give up on my emotions

178
00:24:50,099 --> 00:24:58,119
沈黙を破って あまのじゃくな瞳の その奥に触れて 感じさせてよ
Breaking the silence, touching deep into those contrary eyes, make me feel it

179
00:25:00,535 --> 00:25:02,435
暗闇に咲く葛藤と
With the inner conflict blooming in the dark...

180
00:25:04,685 --> 00:25:07,035
見つめ合っていたい
Wanting to gaze at each other...

181
00:25:09,235 --> 00:25:12,635
引き足の静けさに気づかないふりして
Pretending not to notice the quietness of our retreating steps,

182
00:25:14,335 --> 00:25:17,035
鬱陶しいくらいの熱量に
In this stifling, passionate heat...

183
00:25:17,385 --> 00:25:21,085
あぁ もう少し浮かされていたいな
Ah, I want to stay captivated just a little longer,

184
00:25:21,585 --> 00:25:24,685
息を呑んで 焼き付けて
Hold your breath and sear it into your heart,

185
00:25:25,235 --> 00:25:32,685
忘れたくない繚乱の高揚を
This unforgettable euphoria we never want to lose,

186
00:25:39,035 --> 00:25:41,985
最高の最後まで目をそらさないで
Don't look away until the very end, until the absolute peak!

187
00:29:56,285 --> 00:30:01,333
[Title: ray] 作詩・作曲：藤原基央
[Title: ray] Lyrics & Music: Motoo Fujiwara

188
00:30:11,543 --> 00:30:17,803
お別れしたのはもっと 前の事だったような
It feels like we said our goodbyes even longer ago than that...

189
00:30:18,363 --> 00:30:24,803
悲しい光は封じ込めて 踵すり減らしたんだ
I bottled up the sorrowful light and wore down my heels.

190
00:30:25,363 --> 00:30:31,823
君といた時は見えた 今は見えなくなった
When I was with you I could see it, but now it's out of sight.

191
00:30:32,363 --> 00:30:38,823
透明な彗星をぼんやりと でもそれだけ探している
Gazing blankly at the transparent comet, yet that's all I'm searching for.

192
00:30:39,343 --> 00:30:45,803
しょっちゅう唄を歌ったよ その時だけのメロディーを
I sang songs all the time, melodies meant just for that moment...

193
00:30:46,363 --> 00:30:52,823
寂しくなんかなかったよ ちゃんと寂しくなれたから
I wasn't lonely at all, because I was able to feel properly lonely.

194
00:30:54,363 --> 00:31:01,823
いつまでどこまでなんて 正常か異常かなんて
Wondering until when or how far, or whether it's normal or abnormal...

195
00:31:02,243 --> 00:31:08,803
考える暇も無い程 歩くのは大変だ
Walking is hard enough without even having time to think about it...

196
00:31:09,143 --> 00:31:15,823
楽しい方がずっといいよ ごまかして笑っていくよ
Having fun is always better, I'll gloss over it and keep smiling.

197
00:31:16,243 --> 00:31:22,803
大丈夫だ あの痛みは 忘れたって消えやしない
It's alright, that pain won't disappear even if I forget it.

198
00:31:23,363 --> 00:31:30,803
理想で作った道を 現実が塗り替えていくよ
Reality is painting over the path made of ideals.

199
00:31:31,143 --> 00:31:37,823
思い出はその軌跡の上で 輝きになって残っている
Memories remain shining atop that path.

200
00:31:38,363 --> 00:31:44,803
お別れしたのは何で 何のためだったんだろうな
I wonder why and for what purpose we said goodbye.

201
00:31:45,363 --> 00:31:51,823
悲しい光が僕の影を 前に長く伸ばしている
The sorrowful light stretches my shadow far ahead.

202
00:31:52,363 --> 00:31:58,803
時々熱が出るよ 時間がある時眠るよ
Sometimes I run a fever, I sleep when I have time.

203
00:31:59,343 --> 00:32:06,823
夢だと解るその中で 君と会ってからまた行こう
Within the dream I know is a dream, let's meet and then go again.

204
00:32:07,243 --> 00:32:13,803
晴天とはほど遠い 終わらない暗闇にも
Far from clear skies, even in the endless darkness...

205
00:32:14,343 --> 00:32:20,823
星を思い浮かべたなら すぐ銀河の中だ
If you picture the stars, you're right inside the galaxy...

206
00:32:21,363 --> 00:32:28,803
あまり泣かなくなっても 靴を新しくしても
Even if I don't cry as much anymore, even with brand new shoes...

207
00:32:29,143 --> 00:32:35,823
大丈夫だ あの痛みは 忘れたって消えやしない
It's alright, that pain won't disappear even if I forget it.

208
00:32:36,363 --> 00:32:42,823
伝えたかった事が きっとあったんだろうな
There must have been something I really wanted to tell you.

209
00:32:43,363 --> 00:32:50,823
恐らくありきたりなんだろうけど こんなにも
It's probably cliché, but even so...

210
00:33:05,363 --> 00:33:11,823
お別れした事は 出会った事と繋がっている
Saying goodbye is connected to having met in the first place.

211
00:33:12,363 --> 00:33:18,803
あの透明な彗星は 透明だから無くならない
That transparent comet never disappears because it is transparent.

212
00:33:19,363 --> 00:33:26,823
◯×△どれかなんて 皆と比べてどうかなんて
Wondering whether it's a circle, cross, or triangle, or how it compares to everyone else...

213
00:33:27,363 --> 00:33:33,823
確かめる間も無い程 生きるのは最高だ
Living is so wonderful that there's no time to even check...

214
00:33:34,363 --> 00:33:40,823
あまり泣かなくなっても ごまかして笑っていくよ
Even if I don't cry as much anymore, I'll gloss over it and keep smiling.

215
00:33:41,363 --> 00:33:47,823
大丈夫だ あの痛みは 忘れたって消えやしない
It's alright, that pain won't disappear even if I forget it.

216
00:33:48,363 --> 00:33:55,823
大丈夫だ この光の始まりには 君がいる
It's alright, at the very beginning of this light, you are there.

217
00:38:52,526 --> 00:38:57,826
引き抜くカセット 押し込むリセット
Pulling out the cassette, pushing in the reset...

218
00:38:58,126 --> 00:39:01,626
迷い込む迷路 進めどもダルセーニョ
Wandering into a maze, advancing yet Dal Segno...

219
00:39:03,126 --> 00:39:09,526
ドアの先に僕の背中が見えた 振り向いた先に希望が見えた
Beyond the door, my own back appeared... when I turned around, hope was in sight.

220
00:39:10,126 --> 00:39:13,726
地獄の果てなどどこにあるのか 出口はまだなの？
Where could the edge of hell be? Is there still no exit?

221
00:39:16,126 --> 00:39:21,026
くるくるくるくる くりかえす くりかえす くりかえす くりかえす
Spinning round and round, repeating over and over again...

222
00:39:22,026 --> 00:39:27,526
ふらふらふらふら ふらくたる ふらくたる ふらくたる ふらくたる
Stumbling and swaying, fractal upon fractal...

223
00:39:40,026 --> 00:39:45,026
空回るソウト 終わらないロード
Spinning idle thoughts, an endless road...

224
00:39:46,026 --> 00:39:50,026
鉄臭い酸素 届かないSOS
Iron-scented oxygen, an unreachable SOS...

225
00:39:51,026 --> 00:39:56,026
落ちてた柘榴で飢えを凌いだ 頭蓋の中から耳鳴りがした
Sustaining hunger with fallen pomegranates, a ringing echoed from within my skull...

226
00:39:57,026 --> 00:40:00,826
進めど進めど変わりないなら 抗う意味など
If advancing step by step changes nothing, what is the point in fighting back...

227
00:40:08,211 --> 00:40:13,221
そう 騙し騙しで ハグして縛り付けて 魂交わして 天変地異でさよなら
Yes, tricking and tricking, hugging and binding, mingling souls, saying goodbye with a cataclysm!

228
00:40:13,541 --> 00:40:18,511
うん 悲しい噺してん 愉しいね 期待込めて 優と劣を成す 五芒星をタップ
Yeah, telling sorrowful tales, how fun, full of expectation, tapping the pentagram that makes superiority and inferiority!

229
